},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}\">\\(\\mathrm{KummerComplex}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09df50f7db3de7ca\" href=\"?note=09df50f7db3de7ca\" title=\"43-df-kummer-complex\">43-df-kummer-complex</a>，采用其固定加性亏损的定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对长度区间进行阶段构造；若区间所有前段一直过分可压缩，则枚举进入集合造成过多不同的短描述输出，违背计数上界。草稿初始化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0=0,t_{k+1}=2t_k\">\\(t_0=0,t_{k+1}=2t_k\\)</span> 会退化，证明理解为正初始值或使用从正长度开始的区间，未照抄该退化递归。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.1.4；印刷页 570–571，PDF 页 590–591。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kummer-complex","status":"resolved","id":"09df50f7db3de7ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kummer-complex]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kummer-complex","status":"resolved","id":"09df50f7db3de7ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KummerComplex}$ 见 [[43-df-kummer-complex]]，采用其固定加性亏损的定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KummerComplex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{KummerComplex}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"t_0=0,t_{k+1}=2t_k","display":false}],"bytes":1412,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-480","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kummer-complex-exists]] — Existence of Kummer Complex c.e. Sets"}],"outgoing":["09df50f7db3de7ca"]}